  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5751e45b3bc551448917ed569792a2a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 23
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: 'My name is Premou. I carry with me all the information about the terrible
    fate of Proima, our planet. This is all I could\ngather in the little time that
    I had left in this world.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    \n\nWe were visited by an advanced probe from beyond the skies. We believe its
    job was to detect water and broadcast its\nlocation to whoever built it. Soon
    after the device''s arrival, our whole planet was surrounded by red lights, originated
    from\ntheir spaceships. It took us too long to figure out their intentions, but
    I doubt there was anything we could have done about\nit.                                                                                                                                                                                       
    \n\nThe temperature of our planet rose, and the oceans began to evaporate at
    an alarming rate. Our best guess is that these\ninvaders are capable of absorbing
    the water in the air without needing to enter the atmosphere. They achieve this
    by\nartificially boiling the planet, ignoring anything and anyone beneath them.                                                                                                                                                                                       
    \n\nBefore we could even react, we were forced to retreat deep into the underground
    caves. Our cities crumbled to dust as the\nsurface became dry and devoid of life.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    \n\nWe never had the chance to contact them. We never got to fight back. We never
    even had a glimpse of what they looked\nlike. We were killed without notice,
    in such a quick and merciless way.                                                                                                                                                                                       
    \n\nIf anyone ever finds this, take it as a warning. Your planet might not be
    safe.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    \n\n- Premou, last of the Povann.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                '
  currentText: 'My name is ******. I carry with me all the information about the
    terrible fate of ******, our planet, that I could gather in

    the little time
    that I had left.


    We were visited by an advanced device from beyond the
    sky. We believe its job was to detect ***** and notify ********

    species
    built it about its location.

    Soon after its arrival, red lights surrounded
    our whole planet, originating from their spaceships.

    It took us too long
    to figure out what they were doing, but I doubt there was anything we could have
    done about it.


    The temperatures began to rapidly rise, and our ***** evaporated
    at incredible speeds.

    Our best guess is that these ******** are capable
    of absorbing the ***** in the air without needing to enter the

    atmosphere,
    and they do it by artificially boiling the planet below them.


    Before we
    could even figure anything out, we were forced to retreat deep into the underground
    caves.

    Our cities crumbled to dust as the ******* became dry and devoid
    of life.


    We never had the chance to contact them. We never got to fight
    back. We never even saw how they looked.

    We were killed without notice in
    such a quick and merciless way.


    If anyone ever finds this, use this as
    a warning. Your planet might not be safe.


    ******, last of the Povann.'
